          "decision": "escalate",
          "reason": "Line 98 constructs an LDAP DN by concatenating person.getName() without sanitization (unlike the search() method which uses ESAPI_Encoder.encodeForLDAP), creating a plausible LDAP injection vector if person data is attacker-controlled.",
          "error": null,
          "elapsed_seconds": 1.725
