          "Resolve the file path via a fixed base directory and canonicalize it (File.getCanonicalPath()), then verify it still resides within the intended base directory before use.",
          "Reject or sanitize input containing '..', '/', or '\\\\' sequences before using it in file operations.",
          "Consider using an allow-list of permitted filenames instead of directly deriving the path from user input."
