        "remediation": [
          "Avoid invoking a shell (sh -c / cmd.exe /c) with concatenated user input; instead pass command and arguments as separate list elements to ProcessBuilder without shell interpretation.",
          "If shell invocation is unavoidable, strictly whitelist allowed characters/values for the header and reject or escape any shell metacharacters.",
          "Use a well-vetted OS command execution library that safely handles argument escaping.",
