        "exploitability_evidence": "The flagged sink is `pb.start()` where args includes `\"echo \" + param`, and param comes from `scr.getTheValue(\"BenchmarkTest00051\")`. The body of `SeparateClassRequest.getTheValue` is shown and it unconditionally returns the hardcoded string \"bar\", ignoring the input parameter entirely and never touching the underlying HttpServletRequest object. Therefore no attacker-controlled data reaches the ProcessBuilder command construction; the value is a compile-time constant.",
