        "remediation": [
          "Use java.sql.PreparedStatement with parameterized queries instead of building SQL via string concatenation.",
          "Bind the cookie-derived value as a parameter (setString) rather than embedding it directly in the SQL text.",
          "Apply strict input validation/allow-listing on cookie values before use in any downstream logic.",
          "Avoid passing untrusted input through opaque pass-through methods (like Thing1/Thing2) that provide no actual sanitization; ensure any 'sanitizing' component enforces real encoding for the target context (SQL, not just identity transformation)."
        ]
      }
