        "impact": "An attacker can inject arbitrary OS commands by supplying shell metacharacters in the 'BenchmarkTest00159' HTTP header, leading to arbitrary command execution on the server with the privileges of the web application process, potentially resulting in full system compromise, data exfiltration, or lateral movement.",
