        "remediation": [
          "Use java.sql.PreparedStatement with parameterized queries instead of Statement.executeUpdate with concatenated SQL.",
          "Never build SQL strings via string concatenation with attacker-controlled input.",
          "If dynamic SQL is unavoidable, apply strict allow-list validation and proper escaping specific to the SQL dialect used.",
          "Avoid using pass-through helper/reflection-based transformation classes as if they were sanitizers; ensure any intended sanitizer actually neutralizes SQL metacharacters."
