          "Resolve the final path against the intended base directory and verify (via canonical path comparison) that it remains within that directory before opening the file.",
          "Maintain an allow-list of permitted file names/headers rather than trusting arbitrary header values to construct file paths.",
          "Avoid deriving file system paths directly from any HTTP request data (headers, parameters, etc.)."
        ]
