        "remediation": [
          "Use parameterized queries / PreparedStatement (or Spring JdbcTemplate's parameterized update methods) instead of string concatenation.",
          "Validate and strictly whitelist header input if it must be used in a query.",
          "Avoid using raw batchUpdate(String sql) with untrusted input; use batchUpdate with a PreparedStatementSetter or bind parameters."
        ]
