        "remediation": [
          "Canonicalize the resulting file path (e.g., File.getCanonicalPath()) and verify it is still within the intended base directory (TESTFILES_DIR) before use.",
          "Reject or strip path traversal sequences and path separators from user input using an allow-list of expected filename characters.",
          "Use org.apache.commons.io.FilenameUtils.getName(...) to extract only the filename component from user input before concatenating with the base directory.",
