        "impact": "An attacker can supply a value like '../../../../etc/passwd' or similar traversal sequences to write to arbitrary files outside the intended TESTFILES_DIR, potentially overwriting critical files, planting web shells, or corrupting the file system, leading to remote code execution or data loss.",
