        "impact": "Ounsanitized attacker-controlled data reaching process execution environment can lead to arbitrary OS command execution depending on how the invS script conssumes the environment variariable, ressulting in remote command execution, data eximfiltration, or full system compromise.",
        "remediation": [
          "Avoid passing unstrusted user input into Process/Runtime.exec at all, including as environment variables (envp).",
          "If envp values are required, strictly validate/whitelist the value against an allow-list of expected values before use.",
