        "root_cause": "The helper method getTheValue() does not actually read the HTTP request parameter (it's hardcoded to return \"bar\"), and additionally the ternary expression `(7*18)+num>200` is a constant-folding condition that always evaluates to true, causing the code to always use the literal \"This_should_always_happen\" instead of the (already non-tainted) param value. No attacker-controlled data reaches the ProcessBuilder/exec sink.",
