        "impact": "An attacker who controls the 'BenchmarkTest00968' cookie value can inject arbitrary shell metacharacters (e.g., ';', '|', '&&', backticks) to execute arbitrary OS commands on the server with the privileges of the web application process, leading to full server compromise, data exfiltration, or further lateral movement.",
        "remediation": [
          "Avoid invoking a shell (sh -c / cmd.exe /c) with user-influenced strings; instead invoke the target binary directly with an argument array so the OS does not re-parse the string for shell metacharacters.",
