          "Avoid writing raw request-derived data directly with response.getWriter().print(); use a templating/view technology that auto-escapes output (JSP/JSF EL, Thymeleaf, etc.).",
          "Validate/whitelist the expected format of header values where feasible instead of trusting arbitrary content.",
          "Set appropriate Content-Security-Policy headers as defense in depth."
