          "Apply strict input validation/allow-listing on the header value before use.",
          "Avoid using string-built SQL for INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE operations even in helper methods; ensure any pass-through helper (Test.doSomething) does not strip needed sanitization."
        ]
      }
    },
