        "impact": "An attacker could supply a header name containing directory traversal sequences (e.g., '../../etc/passwd') to make the application probe or resolve to files outside the intended TESTFILES_DIR, potentially disclosing file existence or, if the code path is later extended to reads/writes, arbitrary file access.",
