          "Use org.apache.commons.io.FilenameUtils.getName(bar) to strip any directory components before concatenating with TESTFILES_DIR.",
          "Reject or escape header names/values containing '..' or path separator characters before using them to build file paths.",
          "Avoid deriving file names directly from unauthenticated request headers; use an internal mapping/allow-list instead."
        ]
      }
