          "Avoid writing directly to the raw OutputStream/Writer for dynamic content; use a templating/view technology (JSP with JSTL c:out, JSF, Thymeleaf) that auto-escapes output.",
          "Do not trust the Referer header for any output; validate/sanitize all externally supplied headers before use.",
          "If doSomething() is intended to sanitize input, ensure its implementation actually performs context-appropriate encoding for HTML output and verify this with tests."
