          "Replace java.sql.Statement with java.sql.PreparedStatement and bind 'bar' as a parameter instead of concatenating it into the SQL string.",
          "Apply strict input validation/allow-listing on header values used in queries.",
          "Enable least-privilege DB accounts to limit blast radius of any injection."
        ]
      }
