          "Strictly validate/allow-list the header value (e.g., enforce expected format such as numeric employee ID) before use.",
          "Escape special XPath characters (quotes, brackets, operators) if parameterization is not feasible.",
          "Avoid trusting HTTP header values as identifiers without validation, since headers are attacker-controllable."
