        "remediation": [
          "HTML-encode the tainted value before writing it to the response (e.g., using OWASP Java Encoder's Encode.forHtml()).",
          "Avoid using request-derived strings as format templates; treat them strictly as data arguments, not as the format string.",
          "Use a templating/view technology (JSP/JSF) that auto-escapes output instead of writing directly to the raw Writer/OutputStream.",
          "Validate/allow-list the expected parameter format (e.g., alphanumeric) before use."
        ]
