          "If shell invocation is unavoidable, strip or escape all shell metacharacters and use ProcessBuilder with an explicit argument list rather than string concatenation.",
          "Consider using a Java API alternative (e.g., InetAddress.isReachable for ping-like functionality) instead of shelling out."
