        "remediation": [
          "Bind 'bar' as a PreparedStatement parameter (e.g., add a second '?' placeholder for PASSWORD and use statement.setString(2, bar)) instead of concatenating it into the SQL string.",
          "Avoid building SQL strings via concatenation with any user-supplied input; use fully parameterized queries for all variable parts of the SQL.",
          "Validate/allow-list the input if it must be used outside of parameter binding for some reason.",
          "Ensure any helper methods like Test.doSomething() do not silently pass through untrusted data without sanitization if used in security-sensitive contexts."
        ]
      }
