        "remediation": [
          "Use parameterized/templated LDAP filters for all user-controlled values (as already done for the 'street' clause) rather than string concatenation for 'bar'.",
          "Escape LDAP special characters (\\, *, (, ), NUL) in user input before including it in any filter string, e.g., using an LDAP encoding utility such as ESAPI's encodeForLDAP or javax.naming filter escaping helpers.",
          "Validate/allowlist the expected format of the 'BenchmarkTest01327' parameter before use in the query."
