        }
      },
      "analysis": {
        "exploitability_evidence": "Source: request.getParameterMap() reads parameter 'BenchmarkTest01335' into 'param' (fully attacker-controlled). This value is passed to new Test().doSomething(request, param) and returned as 'bar'; the doSomething() implementation is not shown here, but no evidence of any encoding/sanitization is present in the visible code path. 'bar' is placed into an Object[] and passed to PrintWriter.format(...) which writes '%1$s'/'%2$s' formatted output directly to the HTTP response body inside an HTML context, with no HTML-encoding (e.g., no ESAPI/OWASP encoder, no view templating) applied anywhere on the path. response.setHeader('X-XSS-Protection','0') even disables the browser's built-in XSS filter. Since PrintWriter.format performs no escaping and the helper method's body isn't shown to introduce sanitization, the tainted parameter reaches the raw output sink unescaped.",
        "verdict": "True Positive",
        "confidence": "medium",
        "severity_assessment": "medium",
        "root_cause": "User-supplied HTTP parameter is passed through an unshown pass-through helper method and then written to the response via PrintWriter.format() without any HTML/context-aware output encoding, bypassing any templating/auto-escaping mechanism.",
        "impact": "An attacker can inject arbitrary HTML/JavaScript via the 'BenchmarkTest01335' request parameter, resulting in reflected Cross-Site Scripting that can lead to session hijacking, credential theft, or arbitrary actions in the victim's browser context.",
        "remediation": [
          "HTML-encode user-controlled data before writing to the response (e.g., use OWASP Java Encoder's Encode.forHtml() or ESAPI encoder) at the point of output.",
          "Avoid direct PrintWriter/OutputStream writes for dynamic content; use a templating engine (JSP/JSF/Thymeleaf) that auto-escapes output.",
          "Do not disable X-XSS-Protection header; keep browser XSS filtering enabled as defense-in-depth.",
          "Validate/allowlist the parameter value if a restricted format is expected."
        ]
      }
    },
