        "remediation": [
          "Avoid invoking a shell interpreter for user-influenced commands; use ProcessBuilder with an explicit argument list (not string concatenation) and avoid 'sh -c'/'cmd.exe /c' wrapping.",
          "Strictly validate/whitelist the parameter value (e.g., allow only alphanumeric characters) before using it in any command.",
          "If shell invocation is unavoidable, use a robust escaping/quoting library appropriate for the target shell, and confirm Test.doSomething() does not merely pass through the tainted value.",
