        "remediation": [
          "Use org.apache.commons.io.FilenameUtils.getName(...) to strip any directory components from the user-supplied value before use.",
          "Canonicalize the resulting File path and verify it resides within the intended base directory (Utils.TESTFILES_DIR) before opening it.",
          "Reject or sanitize input containing path traversal sequences such as '../' or absolute path indicators.",
          "Avoid deriving filenames directly from request parameter names/values; use an indirect mapping (e.g., an allow-list or lookup table) to known safe file identifiers."
