          "Encode all user-controlled data before writing to the response using a context-aware encoder (e.g., OWASP Java Encoder's Encode.forHtml()) prior to printf()/writer output.",
          "Avoid using raw request parameter names/values as format strings; treat any user input as data, not as format-string content.",
          "Do not disable browser XSS protections (remove response.setHeader('X-XSS-Protection','0')).",
          "Prefer a templating/view technology (JSP EL, JSF, Thymeleaf) that auto-escapes output instead of writing directly to the response Writer/OutputStream."
        ]
      }
