        "remediation": [
          "Use parameterized queries/CallableStatement placeholders (?) instead of string concatenation for building the SQL/call statement.",
          "Validate and whitelist parameter names before using them to select behavior or build SQL text.",
          "Avoid using raw HTTP parameter names as a proxy for selecting SQL fragments or procedure names; use a safe lookup/mapping instead.",
          "Apply strict input validation/allow-listing on any value that ultimately influences the SQL text."
        ]
      }
