        "impact": "An attacker can inject arbitrary OS commands by supplying shell metacharacters in the BenchmarkTest01600 parameter, potentially leading to remote code execution, data exfiltration, or full server compromise.",
        "remediation": [
          "Avoid invoking a shell interpreter with concatenated user input; instead pass the command and arguments as separate list elements without shell wrapping (e.g., avoid sh -c \"echo \" + bar).",
