        "impact": "An attacker can inject shell metacharacters (e.g., ; , | , & , $() ) into the BenchmarkTest01601 parameter to execute arbitrary OS commands with the privileges of the web application process, leading to full server compromise, data exfiltration, or lateral movement.",
        "remediation": [
          "Avoid invoking a shell interpreter (sh -c / cmd.exe /c) with user input; use ProcessBuilder with an argument array and no shell wrapper.",
