        "remediation": [
          "Use parameterized queries (PreparedStatement/CallableStatement with '?' placeholders) instead of string concatenation.",
          "Never build SQL/callable-statement syntax by concatenating raw user input; validate input against a strict allow-list if dynamic SQL structure is unavoidable.",
          "Apply least-privilege database accounts to limit damage from potential injection."
        ]
