        "impact": "An attacker can manipulate the SQL WHERE clause (e.g., via classic ' OR '1'='1 payloads) to bypass authentication logic, extract or modify unauthorized data, or in some database configurations execute stacked queries, leading to full compromise of the USERS table data.",
        "remediation": [
          "Replace java.sql.Statement with a PreparedStatement using bind parameters (e.g., '... WHERE USERNAME=? AND PASSWORD=?') and set values via setString().",
