        "remediation": [
          "Use parameterized queries / PreparedStatement with bind variables instead of string concatenation for the SQL command.",
          "Avoid building SQL from untrusted input; use an ORM or query builder that enforces parameterization.",
          "Apply strict input validation/allow-listing on cookie values before use in any downstream sink.",
          "Do not rely on HTML encoding as a SQL injection mitigation; encoding for output context (HTML) is unrelated to SQL context sanitization."
