        "remediation": [
          "Use PreparedStatement with parameterized queries instead of Statement.executeUpdate with concatenated strings.",
          "Validate/allow-list the cookie value format if it must remain a raw string, but prefer parameterization as the primary defense.",
          "Avoid using ESAPI HTML encoding as a substitute for SQL escaping \u2014 it does not protect the SQL execution."
        ]
      }
