        "confidence": "medium",
        "severity_assessment": "medium",
        "root_cause": "User-controlled HTTP header (Referer) is decoded and reflected into the HTTP response writer without output encoding or use of an auto-escaping view technology, allowing injected HTML/JavaScript to be rendered by the browser.",
