          "Avoid writing raw request-derived data directly via response.getWriter(); use a templating engine (JSP/JSF) that auto-escapes output.",
          "Validate/allow-list the Referer header format if it must be used, rejecting or stripping unexpected characters.",
          "Set appropriate Content-Security-Policy headers as defense in depth."
        ]
