        "impact": "An attacker who controls the 'BenchmarkTest01929' HTTP header can inject shell metacharacters (e.g., ; , | , `` ` `` , $()) to execute arbitrary OS commands with the privileges of the web application process, leading to full system compromise, data exfiltration, or lateral movement.",
