        "remediation": [
          "Use parameterized queries / PreparedStatement with bind variables instead of string concatenation.",
          "If dynamic SQL is unavoidable, use a strict allow-list validator or ESAPI's database-specific encoder (encodeForSQL) rather than encodeForHTML.",
          "Apply the principle of least privilege to the DB account executing this query.",
          "Verify and harden the doSomething() helper method to ensure it does not merely pass through untrusted input."
        ]
      }
