          "Resolve the target file against a fixed, trusted base directory and use File.getCanonicalPath() to verify the resolved path is still within that base directory before use.",
          "Reject or strip path traversal sequences (e.g., '..', absolute path prefixes) from user-supplied input using a strict allow-list validator instead of just HTML-encoding for output.",
          "Use org.apache.commons.io.FilenameUtils.getName(...) to extract only the file name component when a bare filename is expected, discarding any directory path.",
          "Avoid deriving file system paths directly from HTTP headers; if unavoidable, apply strict input validation (e.g., regex allow-list of expected characters) before using the value in File operations."
        ]
      }
