          "Avoid writing directly to the raw PrintWriter/OutputStream for dynamic content; use a templating engine (JSP EL with escaping, JSF, Thymeleaf) that auto-escapes output.",
          "Validate/allow-list the Referer header format before use, and treat all headers as untrusted input.",
          "Set appropriate Content-Security-Policy headers as defense in depth."
