          "Replace Statement with PreparedStatement and bind 'bar' as a parameter instead of concatenating it into the SQL string.",
          "Apply strict input validation/allow-listing on the header value before use.",
          "Ensure the doSomething() helper does not strip out any sanitization if it's meant to; audit its actual implementation to confirm no encoding is silently applied elsewhere.",
          "Adopt an ORM or query builder that enforces parameterized queries by default."
        ]
      }
