        "confidence": "medium",
        "severity_assessment": "high",
        "root_cause": "User-controlled HTTP header value flows unsanitized through URL decoding and an apparent passthrough helper into a SQL statement built via string concatenation, then executed with Statement.executeUpdate instead of a parameterized PreparedStatement.",
