        "remediation": [
          "Never pass user-controlled data as raw environment variable entries to Runtime.exec/ProcessBuilder.",
          "If environment customization is required, use a strict allow-list of variable names/values and validate format (KEY=VALUE) and content.",
          "Prefer ProcessBuilder with an explicit, minimal, and hard-coded environment rather than including any user input.",
          "Avoid invoking external shell scripts that rely on ambient/untrusted environment variables; use safer, in-process alternatives where possible."
        ]
