        "remediation": [
          "Use PreparedStatement or Spring JdbcTemplate parameterized queries with bind variables instead of string concatenation.",
          "Validate/whitelist input format for the BenchmarkTest02174 parameter before use.",
          "Avoid passing raw, unparameterized SQL through helper methods like doSomething without sanitization tailored to SQL context."
        ]
