        "remediation": [
          "Use parameterized LDAP filters exclusively (bind ALL variable parts via SearchControls filter arguments/{n} placeholders instead of string concatenation).",
          "Apply an LDAP-specific encoder such as ESAPI's Encoder.encodeForLDAP() (or equivalent) to escape special characters (e.g., '(', ')', '\\', '*', NUL) in the 'bar' value before building the filter string.",
          "Validate/allow-list input format for the parameter (e.g., restrict to expected characters such as alphanumeric) before use.",
          "Review the doSomething() helper to ensure it does not simply pass through tainted data unmodified; centralize sanitization there if it is meant to serve that purpose."
