        "confidence": "medium",
        "severity_assessment": "high",
        "root_cause": "User-supplied HTTP parameter is concatenated into a shell command string (or passed as an argv element to /bin/sh -c or cmd.exe) without any escaping, whitelisting, or command-argument separation that would neutralize shell metacharacters before being passed to Runtime.exec().",
