        "remediation": [
          "Avoid invoking a shell (sh -c) with user-controlled input; use a fixed set of command arguments without shell interpretation.",
          "Apply strict allow-list validation (e.g., alphanumeric only) to the user-supplied value before use in any command.",
          "Use Java APIs (e.g., java.nio.file) for filesystem operations instead of shelling out to 'ls' or 'echo'.",
          "If exec is unavoidable, pass arguments as an array without invoking a shell, and validate/escape each argument individually."
        ]
