        "confidence": "high",
        "severity_assessment": "high",
        "root_cause": "User-supplied HTTP parameter is concatenated directly into a SQL query string before being sent to the database via prepareStatement/execute, without any sanitization, escaping, or use of a bind parameter for that portion of the query.",
