        "remediation": [
          "Bind the `bar` value using a PreparedStatement parameter (e.g., statement.setString(2, bar)) instead of concatenating it into the SQL string.",
          "Avoid building SQL text via string concatenation with any HTTP-derived value.",
          "If doSomething() is intended to sanitize input, verify it uses parameter binding or a vetted SQL-specific escaping routine rather than ad-hoc string manipulation.",
