          "Avoid passing user input into Runtime.exec/ProcessBuilder in any parameter (argv or envp) without validation.",
          "If per-request customization is required, use ProcessBuilder with a fixed argument list and validate/whitelist any values before adding them as arguments (never as raw exec/envp strings)."
