        "remediation": [
          "Use a fully parameterized query with a placeholder for the PASSWORD value as well (e.g., PASSWORD=?) and bind 'bar' via statement.setString(2, bar) instead of concatenating it into the SQL string.",
          "Validate/whitelist the expected format of the parameter before use.",
          "Avoid building SQL strings via concatenation of any request-derived value, even when other parts of the query use placeholders."
