          "Validate and whitelist expected input format for the parameter before use.",
          "Avoid using raw execute(String sql) with untrusted, concatenated input; use bind variables instead.",
          "Do not rely on output encoding (ESAPI encodeForHTML) as a mitigation for SQL injection; it only protects against XSS in the HTML response."
        ]
      }
