        "remediation": [
          "Use a parameterized query (PreparedStatement or NamedParameterJdbcTemplate) instead of concatenating user input into the SQL string.",
          "Validate/whitelist the expected format of the parameter (e.g., alphanumeric only) before use.",
          "Verify that doSomething() does not merely pass through tainted input; if it does, add proper escaping or better use bind variables entirely instead of relying on escaping.",
          "Apply the principle of least privilege to the DB account used by the app to limit blast radius of any injection."
        ]
